      "replacements": [
        [
          "This work-only candidate adds group list/preview and confirmed recursive recycle, permanent delete and previous-parent restoration. It is not installed in Studio.",
          "Group actions provide group list/preview and confirmed recursive recycle, permanent delete and previous-parent restoration."
        ],
        [
          "Future installation, actual browser/HTTP host acceptance and independent review remain pending.",
          "The final guarded candidate passed77 focused checks. The independent root replay passed the exact six previously tested case bodies, including the formerly failing held active-list case. A separate real shared-host HTTP campaign passed two cases through five process starts, including four recycle/restore/purge restarts, native tombstone order, history and encrypted-record checks. A normal shared Studio host and shell additionally passed eight finite browser observations for preview, confirmation, recycling, password reveal, recursive restoration, preview clearing and empty-bin reopening. These are distinct campaigns, not a combined test denominator. Original GUI/full-program executions and timing/resource comparative acceptance remain zero. The original15 managed-load author campaign remains its immutable initial777 epoch; it is not rebound to the corrected client. Current installed-source focused checks are recorded separately after installation. The immutable source and failed/corrected epochs are mapped by the [group preservation manifest](../../results/vault-group-recycle-reviewed-installation-20261013/source-proof/preservation-manifest.json)."
        ]
      ]
    },
